From e73f7f2609fd569944a279b60936b9e5c352c02e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yimura <24669514+Yimura@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 17:21:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 17/17] SystemUI: let a latch timeout release only its own
 latch

onLatched runs outside the selector lock, so a finish could release the
latch before the startable armed its timeout. The orphaned timer then
called releaseAll on whatever latch held 10 s later, force-releasing a
transition mid-run. Number each latch and release only the armed one.
---
 .../yrrp/FoldAnimationStyleSelectorTest.kt     | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../unfold/yrrp/FoldAnimationStyleSelector.kt  | 17 +++++++++++++++++
 .../unfold/yrrp/YrrpFoldAnimationStartable.kt  |  5 ++++-
 3 files changed, 39 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/packages/SystemUI/multivalentTests/src/com/android/systemui/unfold/yrrp/FoldAnimationStyleSelectorTest.kt b/packages/SystemUI/multivalentTests/src/com/android/systemui/unfold/yrrp/FoldAnimationStyleSelectorTest.kt
index a90526386532..05cc60ab9a0f 100644
